{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101588","id":2279610529,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6H4Bih","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101588","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101588.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101588.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101588","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101588/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101588/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101588/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8c6bac54374cc3d42b28a52d08b8d1148893d09c","number":101588,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"(Partially) fix compilation for `OpenBSD`","user":{"login":"MBCX","id":63003002,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDAzMDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63003002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX","html_url":"https://github.com/MBCX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This (partially) fixes #92130, implementing most of the recommended fixes. This touches a lot of systems and even critical engine code `variant.h` which that was a best-guess fix and probably not the best solution (so any help there would be great, not al all experienced touching core engine code).\r\n\r\nThe TLDR of the fixes:\r\n1. Simplified the bsd detection when needed (so that we don't have to _specifically_ check for `freebsd`, or `openbsd`, or `netbsd`, etc.).\r\n2. Disables the `raycast` module.\r\n3. Mapped `quick_exit` to OpenBSD's `_Exit` where its used, see [this comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/92130#issuecomment-2127135908).\r\n4. ~~Directly included `input-event-codes.h` from the Linux kernel. The rationale is that this saves us the hassle of having to figure out if the file is in the BSD variant and where (what I had to do for FreeBSD). Should be safe since the Wayland platform code is the only bit that uses it in all of Godot.~~ Can't include GPL-v2 code.\r\n5. Added missing platform detection for `Jolt`.\r\n6. Prevented OpenBSD's \"ambiguous error\" failure in `variant.h` using `type_traits`.\r\n\r\nAlso, I could only get the export templates to compile, the compiler would crash compiling the file `editor/editor_translation.cpp` with a `out of memory` error. Not sure why.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/84e90d9a-9bc7-4c29-b7d7-de998ca34a41)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":nul